 "So ray A B and ray B A are different rays. They start at different points and point in different directions.",
 "But segment A B and segment B A are the same segment. Same two endpoints, same piece of the line.",
 "Three more words. Collinear means the points lie on the same line.",
 "Coplanar means the points lie on the same plane.",
 "Two lines that cross intersect in a point.",
 "And two planes intersect in a line, like two walls meeting at a corner.",
 "Your turn. Name this figure with the right symbol. Pause the video and try it.|",
